# Track application questionnaire -> "APEX Track Applications (Website)" Google Sheet (in Apex's Drive)
# via a Google Apps Script web app bound to that sheet.
#
# One-time setup (done by someone with access to the sheet in Apex's Drive):
#   1. Open the sheet -> Extensions -> Apps Script.
#   2. Paste the code from scripts/apply-apps-script.gs and Save.
#   3. Deploy -> New deployment -> type "Web app" -> Execute as: Me, Who has access: Anyone -> Deploy.
#   4. Copy the Web app URL (ends in /exec) into the value below (and into Vercel env for production).
GOOGLE_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=
